{"availability":"available","full":"ishworrsubedii/SitBlinkSip","name":"SitBlinkSip","description":"SitBlinkSip helps developers maintain healthy posture, prevent eye strain, and stay hydrated with real-time alerts for posture correction, eye blinking, and water breaks. It's designed to promote well-being during long coding sessions.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-10-10T16:24:28Z","updated":"2026-09-07T17:57:19Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sitblinksip.vercel.app","topics":["computer-vision","eye-tracking","notifications","posture-correcter","sitblinksip"],"demo":"https://sitblinksip.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.536Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.536Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.536Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.536Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository is the marketing site for SitBlinkSip — a free, open-source desktop app for developers and other computer-heavy workers. It watches your posture and blink rate through your webcam, runs quietly in the system tray, and reminds you to sit right, blink bright, and sip well.","The site is a static Next.js app with no backend — everything (posture/blink detection, alerts, storage) runs locally inside the desktop app itself, which lives in a separate repository: desktop-sitblinksip."],"features":["Real-time Posture Monitoring: Detects improper posture (slouching or leaning) and alerts users","Eye Blink Detection: Monitors eye blinking, sending a notification if no blink is detected for","over 60 seconds to prevent dry eyes.","Water Break Reminders: Sends periodic notifications to ensure users stay hydrated.","Fully Local: All computer-vision processing happens on-device. Nothing to host, no account, no"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ishworrsubedii/SitBlinkSip/blob/main/README.md","fi